# X301 laboratory OpenSSL overlay

Installing `x301-openssl-provider-policy` installs an OpenSSL configuration
overlay that places `X301MLKEM1024` before the nonempty group list generated
by the selected Fedora crypto policy.

This is not a native Fedora `.pmod`. Do not install or retain this package with
FIPS, BSI, EMPTY or another policy whose OpenSSL group list is empty or closed.
Remove the package and regenerate the selected crypto policy before switching
to such a policy.
